flowchart TD
    Init["init_net<br/>(default ns)"]
    A["netns A<br/>(ip netns add A)"]
    B["netns B"]

    Init -- "veth peer" --> VethB["vethA1<br/>(peer)"]
    Init -- "physical here" --> Eth0["eth0<br/>(physical NIC)"]

    Br["bridge br0<br/>(in init_net)"] --> VethB
    Br --> Eth0

    A -- "veth pair" --> VethA["vethA0"]
    A -- "loopback" --> LoA["lo"]
    Init --- A
    A --- B

    LoA -.- Note1["Movement:<br/>ip link set vethA0 netns A<br/>ip netns exec A bash<br/>(unshare CLONE_NEWNET)"]
    Note1 -.- Note2["Each ns has own:<br/>- routing table (ip route)<br/>- iptables rules<br/>&nbsp;&nbsp;(sudo nft list ruleset)<br/>- /proc/net/* views<br/>- sockets/listeners<br/>- conntrack zone"]

    classDef ns fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef phys fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef veth fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Init,A,B ns
    class Eth0,Br phys
    class VethA,VethB,LoA veth
